WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.004
Product briefing: intravitreal therapy in DME.

2
00:00:04.454 --> 00:00:09.238
Briefing on intravitreal options for diabetic macular oedema and patient selection.

3
00:00:09.688 --> 00:00:14.831
Clear referral criteria shared between primary care and eye services shorten the time to treatment.

4
00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:21.875
New vessels on the disc or elsewhere need urgent treatment with laser or intravitreal therapy to prevent haemorrhage.

5
00:00:22.325 --> 00:00:27.004
Regular retinal photography detects sight-threatening disease before symptoms appear.

6
00:00:27.454 --> 00:00:31.309
Screening intervals depend on previous results and glycaemic control.
